  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Minor Changes\n\n- Read a license's product variation through `License.VariationId` to distinguish editions in your application. The value is optional for older licenses and trials, and remains available when validating offline licenses. ([#594](https://github.com/Manevann/moonbase/pull/594))\n\n### Patch Changes\n\n- Moonbase now refuses to register a customer with a throwaway email address (Mailinator and the like), so `Register` throws a `UserAuthenticationException` saying the address is disposable. Nothing changes in the SDK itself beyond the documentation of `ErrorType.DisposableEmailAddress`. ([#591](https://github.com/Manevann/moonbase/pull/591))",
